  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c59496cbc07277a86b338d63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿这样拍的「咖哩乌龙面挑战」影片\r\n真的爆红了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93365a1226421997d552bce563d4c6df5cc1440d982f5f419dcec1295b85c867",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5bb9b297d9e9d22252f3ab7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不错吧？休闲又自由的感觉。\r\n一定可以来场神速领头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ab75c2514c38f663a4fd4fc93f9215b2a8ff49b63a4759389bf998c7e2f271",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3086b0d53ad826301acad25c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袖口の肌触りがあげみざわ～って感じ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6ff99bcbf8fc510c36b955f012d79172be1e9d10c8d195a8e0528f3bb8fcd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4a2d425cbdeb0a4c841667b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリパのはしごとかしちゃう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d6b2cec567fc416304adbcf018eaa05b9c4c49a787b3af40b257e3201166c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f888000137e9ac6371d7012",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很适合吧？怎么样呀～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "31eeb4909537506aca4634a8efa34ef354c6e0d2aa2c4a40ff2b2df61003eefa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b112b97809b02af115a927f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，具有特别意义的服装！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a70c518ef6dc82fafb35e3184023f9deb484f2c55453de993a0093c94facd671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bac0b2661c1bbabf8bbc15b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好！\r\n我是其实很高雅的善信哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb1f6b068feb86a3d73106977a827c5462ce475d6c9d59d4f78e62c20fc42bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0c85adcee14f394a0489336",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我总是都挑一些\r\n色系比较沉稳的风格呢。\r\n要不要再加入些玩心呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0221c5db675155e841818ad836c896f314565f11641b5b93fc2142ee3579ccc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:049b292ee57cc985027abdb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很适合吧～\r\n正式服装也不赖呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "605cc077165de15fd03576c50604d8129bee4307a9360db06c458cbb15a8aa2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a528791d93611509711301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唱歌跳舞的善信！\r\n要为台上的我加油喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b94844b6a7d1e2883b09be0f9c822493df69eb470cd921b8e58d40fe0fa352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e70260982496e184e174bb2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样啊？美国风格♪\r\n果然令人感到很嗨呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31ab87edbcfb8292663e7104df8a649850b0afa54a1e6da8267ef9f3ebcf9d47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:421b47e87f958b3ad50a25f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怪了，衣服上的折痕呢？\r\n我明明折出线后熨烫过的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "982cf5d08894007f0b259a5829a842305fceeb5ef382b27fded1341126e714ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e71228c8492a3d46ec43f82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿这样拍的「咖哩乌龙面挑战」影片\r\n真的爆红了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93365a1226421997d552bce563d4c6df5cc1440d982f5f419dcec1295b85c867",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcb727a3cbe2cc1ae599353d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不错吧？休闲又自由的感觉。\r\n一定可以来场神速领头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ab75c2514c38f663a4fd4fc93f9215b2a8ff49b63a4759389bf998c7e2f271",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c9c2003c9df8e61df5a97f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袖口の肌触りがあげみざわ～って感じ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6ff99bcbf8fc510c36b955f012d79172be1e9d10c8d195a8e0528f3bb8fcd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56e06d0764b3858dd026a490",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリパのはしごとかしちゃう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d6b2cec567fc416304adbcf018eaa05b9c4c49a787b3af40b257e3201166c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:270aa4e3bcbd247a3ac69462",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很适合吧？怎么样呀～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "31eeb4909537506aca4634a8efa34ef354c6e0d2aa2c4a40ff2b2df61003eefa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22fb7d66be63676d95f96acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，具有特别意义的服装！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a70c518ef6dc82fafb35e3184023f9deb484f2c55453de993a0093c94facd671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24d82650af07503c2e260cd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2844e10231fb1df80ddf92369741a345d71164ac359effd4df72193851603d28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a377861a130340998816027f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若不来真的立刻就会被我甩掉，\r\n做好心理准备吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f02aef176275664528070bc569393141ce9e3e624112100aa127104b1741dd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4acf01bb841e8e137412209",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，挺行的嘛～\r\n善信小姐也开始加速吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee889a0ee71167be5edad62511dd1b2909c3f58e82f8f00e3a1a38a56565d59a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e88e085ae75c6d11c75b50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早～安啊……哦，\r\n感觉好新鲜！因为我跟熟朋友都是用\r\n「欧耶～」打招呼嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fefd1aabfd1930b6a8850fea09d68332ce437036acc8af66349158d4f72168d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5fe24cff2d6c75f6804f3a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候我常帮光明整理她睡乱的\r\n头发呢……她那满头乱翘的头发\r\n超可爱的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee63d787ff8659e29844b392753f0f140d70f893eaa5dadb3839ef441d97610",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f024f3c125b3b8fd26a8d429",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～中午睡魔袭来，\r\n连善信我都逃不掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e353b42b3bd8bb8157035f16fc88d766d6eb7221b95ee9438ca416a14aad9ab2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db15d4d69fa5df870e5b264c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我经常会去找没有一起\r\n吃过饭的学生吃午餐喔。\r\n目标是集满全校学生！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb8f59bc3b2b1670397e8be2f1282a37d3709b328c547e8df5b89115254226da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb058db477ea8650e3496f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好安静的夜晚……这时候最适合打\r\n高尔夫了，振臂高挥让球飞得远远的\r\n一定会很舒畅呢……（偷瞄）",
      "source_fingerprint": "81314a30b42d0a00ffdef0106b0b7853cd66981b46ba8bee448db2b7eca94eec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760a6126a6ed1a40c3aef7c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到晚上找我商量的信息就会变多。\r\n看来大家都在这段时间感到不安呢～\r\n好，来努力回复啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21372906c75a3e6238926a640971ac530198f043e34250ced4f6a36bce09d653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3168519ac288796f47879048",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年我都会跟麦昆、赖恩一起赏花。\r\n我们还开了一个LANE群组，\r\n叫做「花组」喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "72b56bbecb7746d4238fc2f999435de8491927e0a28871582909e79c48ac342a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:326bc6f71f274c9aeadc3936",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～今天也好热喔。\r\n要不要一起去目白家的度假别墅\r\n悠闲地泡泡海水浴啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3530d047e7994ce45328b072bcd20c746cc953d103494b18a2adab227c2acd59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6dad53ec1ba8626f41cf35c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天真棒呢，可以拍到很多美照♪\r\n枯山水庭院中落叶纷飞，大自然\r\n就是最强的美景，太棒啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "010f99135c13daf67163ac91f38ae86f37c143bc362ceb6fe09f55498dda7c07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d36b86847343e300d97e587f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有看见太阳神吗？她拿走了我的\r\n高尔夫球杆的杆头套子！我明明说过\r\n拿来当手套还是会冷的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e5375626ac77823246a2af9b3093f155428a1bbde491699be06ab10116c1bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29505e148c96c7009afb854e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おっはよー！枕元チェックした？\r\nプレゼントあるかも…って思って\r\n起きると、毎朝楽しいよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7dd7bafb50240d8196b9f4e41883762c9216108940fccf1790cf045910dd359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffae4cf512b82d066a4003ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "う～ん…片側で髪結ぶからさ、\r\n毛先が綺麗にそろわないんだよね。\r\n朝から何回やり直したことか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3d39f95d92246a733a8a919adc3734cbfc408348fa814831032456bb319864d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a88f083ff7d0437497c113a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼に出る時は、日傘がマスト！\r\nないと肩とか焼けちゃうから。\r\nもちろん日焼け止めも欠かさないよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "83472dd4e271d8ec290e5b4c2449ee53a635c95adfa74238b79e1ed47ce912b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd3e4b47384aaddae62082aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ランチは勝負だよ。白い衣装を\r\n着てる時は…特に！！はぁ…\r\n染み抜きホント大変なんだから…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acf867e257c001867c0a1746a97570d07638a7f951e2b0e812ff8ab60a17047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b7b725bb12cdfe53cad0d5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この格好なら、夜空も走れそうな\r\n気がしてさ。流れ星と競走とか…\r\n夜を自由に走るのって、楽しそう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b596066c540784c7a30d7d029bce5de2705bf00c165a42f5933776376513bc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d39c57098ae67c559fae6bc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お仕事頑張るよい子には、私から\r\nプレゼント～！机にお菓子置い\r\nといたから、あとで食べてねっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f3d0b4fbb5b23e4ec6e97665108adb7930735d6dc16a359d483af77b0103e86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a37d9726d2b0f866bf4a4f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "う～ん、春風って気持ちいいね。\r\n読みにくいのもあるけど…それも\r\n春ゴルフの醍醐味ってね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6891cc6ac122620774f18aad2c622623b2ecead5ac8c91fe09d5c61043ddbe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:484f3f1dbe0a0c678866332f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "波乗りサンタってのもいる\r\nらしいね！なら、バカンスで\r\n練習しとくっきゃないっしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64fc58d6340c93d38310b4f928923feec46def44a9567b09f078a64f6a626055",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a213476fae379331633e1e9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実りの秋！そして、収穫の秋！\r\nってことで、私はエースさんの\r\nお手伝いに行ってきまーす！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f8f0e026a33a9130bf184425a6fb53fb334ed42dcda5ac883473efeeddcc9fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e0ec5806c6c568fcd133f9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かまくら作りたくなったら呼んで！\r\n形を整えてくれたら、\r\n後は私が堀ったげるからさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d1096b4bf83348d0fac9b3ecb064441f71223e0f501737ac2668d8796e61b51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:885fe1ea0ee315079859728c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42dac536107c2946b2dbe302",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0b6dcefded2b4a67ebb86f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次我在花式自由赛跑出新纪录喔～\r\n当然，下一个改写新纪录的人\r\n也将会是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b51d1e27f5e5aab5aea18bed256a009dba6bd3ec20a88905bd9ec8bb7fd25943",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6e1562c440f010f4c559614",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我完全不了解红茶品牌，\r\n但我喝得出多伯亲手泡的茶……\r\n会有一股令人安心的味道喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a57aeeb736ab27e4488a0b8a538f39304ed0055827fa45ccf36b6c9d390363b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fecdc860f0e6b3694607f29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我问朋友有没有听过妈妈画的绘本，\r\n结果她说有读过呢！\r\n呵呵，这样啊这样啊～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eea2dd6509a015451380d612fe2808b0bf633b9633eb90d5089c21821ca75fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a5bd4e6c240107c8305705",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麦昆一脸凝重的样子呢。\r\n她背负太多压力了啦～\r\n……我去拿些甜点给她好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70a18a62e6ec9852249226779d80dfe5c5c6e813e633f0dcc1e42b91b0424dcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67a811c7c6c439f31dd42ae5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "My name is 善信……\r\n好像怪怪的……呃，训练员！？\r\n什么？你都听到了？好丢脸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80cf1d32fe12f661d2facfd6fe57a292cfcb1a941d82f69ccaa71ac9bdd3335d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e3f33fb131056804e1f861f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "靴子上有小小的蹄铁呢？\r\n真的很可爱对吧～？\r\n不知道有没有同款式的饰品？",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ab3e8da7e228f5caaa01f41bcb9d559c6e79354d66574bd0492f7955d1276f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aceab0c50db9c52beaa58ff9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要演出演唱会就该站中间！\r\n有这气势是很重要的对吧？\r\n很好，我开始鼓起干劲了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d499cf257e138f7043e3f7df488fe4ee013b9e4390e7d7d785100b0c4788955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc739bff746ce2c3d93271f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……专属于我的决胜服。\r\n光是穿上就感到开始加速了！\r\n有没有哪里正在举办野生的比赛啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "383f0016ea0d6cde86162a4d49410e152c31dd59e2da6f5ce63ea1daee57ef64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6849a9c5dec245737ce9eeb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，这套服装果然不错呢。\r\n这在休闲的设计中凝聚了\r\n我的意欲与心情……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28ab608b59bfb519eab3283157e0775191dd082163c4f067d096f7bb06366ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d4c6a86c4d702e36fcdf29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赖恩的晨练真的很棒喔！\r\n不仅能提升代谢，还可以提高心情。\r\n真不愧是目白家的体能专家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f04c3546188903ac0acad979fe109a37ab3df0d429fc517665589dbfe1b9c27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2966507585287bb1282322eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我姐妹们的辣妹用语今天又更新了！\r\n她们的用词品味让人超佩服的耶！\r\n居然想得到这种用法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ee9deb7f9ac8479cb6489010f58aa2254890f02984c66b29b04a543bc241b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63f40c214014f8f0a64f6370",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还在工作？真假？\r\n要适时休息耶～太勉强自己的话\r\n善信会难过的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26002ff36aa359e52c60801fa11e8e0c9490aa6161aca00f48b0508e2f7cfa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5fff434b04efcf6c4a984a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年的这个时期\r\n我都在四处倾听新生的烦恼喔～\r\n毕竟大家刚入学时都会很不安嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d82f3174c7a65e89edeacd168c1aa83881f015a6fe2bb8d649e4d05a67467d48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c76adbc75ceb83eaede928c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暑假就会想尽情玩耍对吧？\r\n但时间像鬼速领头一下子就不见吧？\r\n……所以哪会有时间写暑假作业啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5185316870e6deaffedbd6e4a3167b2e9015a3a0e2bb0426a01d116615cc5bcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:505c0edcd880780ae4b7b1a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有没有推荐赏红叶的景点？\r\n我想用奔跑卷起满天红叶，\r\n拍张很有气氛的照片！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0103279986bb6fdcc681ee5c8a0ad0301530bc56712676d32e98bdd4f568c7bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e88ce258192492c8d57e7354",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿太多件衣服造型就不好看了～\r\n但又不能感冒……\r\n嗯～这时期真的很烦恼穿衣呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a33fb8c4287efa47be6d8b2b763880151fe18c54411a1ac0c8ea8dc22f83da1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cce341d359f33dbe1f985e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブライトのクリスマス衣装見た！？\r\nお人形みたいでマジかわいいの！\r\n部屋に飾りたいくらいだよ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d40fb97dfb0d34185c949a353b06f18b9be06b25e1bbae6ca80d3a35f2e7de06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66018f6e408da7903b894363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マックイーン、真面目だな～。\r\nお祝いの日は食べ過ぎちゃうもん\r\nでしょ。たまにはいいのにね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8772928d6767e624462a4a53b5dbbbb603dcc238f7cb7f35d769fc6ddcdff41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa3110b2576faba7e3ad7600",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうこの髪型？ヘリオスとおそろ♪\r\nヘアゴムもイロチ！いつでも\r\nどこでもウチらはズッ友ってワケ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d15c9f9970501e6f5565b2d091434fb94d7e45f4bb48508c0212e8d56567dd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:008b321a6e4809cd2763601b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ラモーヌさんとの会話のコツか…。\r\nよく観察すること？ラモーヌさんの\r\n気分に合った話題を振るといいよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a020199a1ecfeeecbf3906a05a99555af4c0928f0eb4ba2a8b9898e3f3c7bf76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88c51a94cf8e7644f1347b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリパでおばあ様の衣装褒めたら、\r\nなんかダンスに誘われちゃってさ…\r\n足踏まないかヒヤヒヤしたよ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0316db31ef9e972dfe55774f147d87999bcde2181267b7d6ea1c7eeb682eb622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:302d5cd65a72832356dc3a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライアンはマジで早起きでさ。\r\n早く朝トレ行っても、先に走ってん\r\nだもん。ちゃんと寝てるのかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e713609b8e98c754829a5d1ec99dbe528289dc5ea33bfc204173d12438794d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00779eea3804a0a0168e210b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ、今日のお昼はメジロのお茶会\r\nやるんだった…今度はどんな\r\nパリピおやつにしよっかな～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "06b273da560e48c3ef52c82af44db0acf92ec640cd2f828029e714ffe68df231",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d91222a8f422a07ec0561404",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドーベルにもらったアロマ使うと、\r\n秒で寝られちゃうんだよね～。\r\nエースさんも感動してたよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69038a210b3ee5ab5d75b7eb4287b32d71314b719998120b912c15835b8c338b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c966fa18b83050fa2077789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年も迷子の新入生たちを案内して\r\nきましたよーっと。来年はそりでも\r\n引いて行こうかな…なんてね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b8c323ff75e7eadf83c7b7a4448c86f22b4b687032dcf2e532aef682726dc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd4e9cf2482944993d32bfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "山と海どっちに行くか…トーゼン！\r\nどっちも行くっしょ！この格好なら\r\nオールラウンド、アゲてけるって！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd7eaa62c6a989acceb7e3edce5d693284702d25e0e20228b6939860860c15c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e9df77e468a63d5ead8a3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋はどこでもイベントの準備してる\r\nよね…足の踏み場もないって感じ！\r\nあはっ、ワクワクしちゃうよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "700f33f786a1c90c181bd2df52c6b3a29b76a8aac98f83df182cc1725821b024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db94273bca346ac0e6265bed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テイオーがクリスマスツリーの仮装\r\nするんだって…なーんか嬉しそう\r\nだったし、手伝ってやるかな～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86dc7ea4a7e601285cbb6b00684176c02439ec9ba3da65f7f2242004e59d6cbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7d712b3382759ae9112b818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスマスとはいえ、メジロの色\r\n背負ってるからねー！マジでやるっ\r\nきゃないっしょ！ご期待あれっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4930dafdab08d432b3671484f2ae4ddabbc4da2adb9e96e1966a64f7e8ac6001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f8ff235c20c83ef0b61074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装でゴルフ場行きたいんだ♪\r\nこれで打ったら、サンタさんの\r\nトナカイみたく飛びそうじゃん？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e2039c2ffb86358f1b1b28bc0e59383d4944b873b3467c45eead63eb330ace",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf2f92cf78dd519ab2d1e459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "莫名就到了训练时间？\r\n好吧，我会好好加油，不会逃跑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82ddad75e680512fce0fd77cb5ca517c40f3ff46f4975062aae1310c9ed1d39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94928038dc11a45ce55c22b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっちゃうよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a425392339db475b620d6c07cf410112f79dea4f276d0aae3c7f780c4c6d630",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb5859785e66c3f9bb64ec7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才不想去管之后的事！\r\n全力以赴直到\r\n「真的不行了～！」为止吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dde6322b7517807e2548fafbcb2d6c1aaa1c543e1d925dc7b8b782ea346cd95a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b637686e6449889d5e953044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听赖恩说了，是叫运动强度吗？\r\n好像很重要呢。也就是得拿出\r\n真本事的意思，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "878cadf9bae182eef37857067ab6e7db4bdad51dad0f178029c39675e2a9c579",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bb60a91627087c9e7dc367f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好空下休息时间喔～？\r\n不只是我的，\r\n训练员你自己也是！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be850f1b0bc448125f7163ed90982f705eb5a1457b6ce12ccb71b4f917390069",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fccd9a179d279c917e14e536",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔陪我一起跑步怎么样啊？\r\n由善信来教你跑步吧！\r\n……逗你的啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b9a0e902d0d246db3a0674a9039ccdcc5ad0a78e020faa42b42de7937e6454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26d7b4ee5b8b81ec815387bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你一直都在为了我努力，\r\n我都看在眼里喔。\r\n训练员，一直以来谢谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0f1e7881c81571123cbe6bac7a46cb314db66c17ffd9e7e44776774daf64fd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1064",
        "92006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
